   "title": "Instruction (set)",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Create an original photorealistic luxury product photography environment. A beautifully sculpted natural travertine stone podium occupies the central foreground. Elegant Mediterranean-inspired architectural surfaces, warm limestone walls, soft ivory plaster, delicate olive branches, natural stone textures. Beautiful late-afternoon sunlight enters from the upper-left side, creating gentle architectural shadows. Warm beige, ivory, sandstone, and muted olive color palette. Professional commercial photography, realistic surface imperfections, subtle depth of field, excellent shadow consistency. Sophisticated minimalist art direction suitable for skincare, fragrance, jewelry, or premium lifestyle products. The central podium must remain completely empty and clearly visible for future product compositing. No bottles, no products, no people, no furniture, no typography, no logos. Original environment and architectural arrangement. Portrait orientation, 4:5."
   ]
